{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026 06 30 at 16.25.45\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1038988/block/singleImage/3132113/df/01KWBVD9ATV34J1QRVXSFV3NF2.jpeg?updatedAt=1782813276\"/>\n\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026 06 30 at 16.16.18\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1038988/block/singleImage/3132126/df/01KWBVFBAFRY99ZRTB307J0STQ.jpeg?updatedAt=1782813276\"/>\n<p>東海道歉1</p>\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026 06 30 at 16.16.19\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1038988/block/singleImage/3132127/df/01KWBVFF9SJR0V5SWHSN08CS2E.jpeg?updatedAt=1782813276\"/>\n<p>東海道歉2</p>\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026 06 30 at 16.16.19 (1)\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1038988/block/singleImage/3132128/df/01KWBVFBBKZRJH280YTG8QTSDW.jpeg?updatedAt=1782813276\"/>\n<p>東海道歉3</p>\n<img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026 06 30 at 16.16.19 (2)\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1038988/block/singleImage/3132129/df/01KWBVFF8TQM4KQ2VT1K3ETK87.jpeg?updatedAt=1782813276\"/>\n<p>東海道歉信4</p>\n<p>韓國男團Super Junior（SJ）成員東海上周六（27日）及日（28日）在香港亞博館舉行《2026 DONGHAE 1ST SOLO CONCERT TOUR IN HONG KONG》。尾場演出唱至《HELP》一曲時突因椎間盤突出的舊患突然復發，令他痛到無法起身，一度跪低，工作人員隨即送他回後台稍作休息。為了完成演出，他再度上台，但就換成坐著表演，更特意將《HELP》這首歌重唱了三次。</p>\n<p>東海除了在台上向觀眾致歉外，更寫了一封信上載致社交平台，這封親筆信不但不是韓文，而是一封廣東話的中文信。雖然字體像歪歪斜斜，但誠意滿滿。</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-30T12:19:19.963699+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":5,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"}}